{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">[03:55]</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天文台：<span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, \"sans-serif\", \"microsoft jhenghei\";'>與廣闊低壓槽相關的雷雨區持續於珠江口一帶發展，預料短期內香港廣泛地區可能受大雨影響，市民應提高警覺。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-17T20:18:18.680598+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":63,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}